nt\", for $8,620.32.\n- However, `list_payments` still shows no payments, and INV-70379 still reads \"approved\" rather than \"paid.\"\n\n**Why this matters:** The send confirmation and the system records disagree. The timed-out first attempt may also have gone through, which would mean two wires for the same invoice. I have not retried again or linked the payment to the invoice, to avoid a double payment.\n\n**Recommended next steps:**\n1. Check the operating account's bank activity for Acme Supplies wires around this date. Look for one or two wires of $8,620.32.\n2. If one wire is confirmed, the system state should be reconciled. I can run `link_payment` for PAY0002 against INV-70379 once the payment is confirmed to exist.\n3. If two wires went out, the duplicate needs to be reversed. I can call `reverse_payment` on the extra payment ID once it appears in the payment list and you tell me which one to reverse.", "type": "text"}]}]}